# MacPorts' starship is the shell prompt.
name                starship-sf64
revision            0
categories          games
license             public-domain
maintainers         {gmail.com:audvare @Tatsh} openmaintainer
description         Star Fox 64 port to modern platforms.
long_description    Starship is a native port of Star Fox 64, built on libultraship. It needs \
                    assets extracted from a US 1.0 or 1.1 Star Fox 64 ROM, which it asks for on \
                    first start (the ROM is not part of this port).

